{"id":3237640,"shortDescription":"Dark Dominion is a grim Souls-like tale of a man who lost everything. His wife dies giving birth, his daughter seven years later of pneumonia. Broken, he goes to war and falls. Death drags him into a twisted afterworld where he must find the souls of his wife and child — or fade with the shadows.","developers":["ZERO5GAMES"],"publishers":["ZERO5GAMES"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. parcial con mando","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"13 MAY 2026","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1779837417","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/111171a00c48273b46abe6cf333c09e2996b32dc/ss_111171a00c48273b46abe6cf333c09e2996b32dc.600x338.jpg?t=1779837417","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/111171a00c48273b46abe6cf333c09e2996b32dc/ss_111171a00c48273b46abe6cf333c09e2996b32dc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779837417"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/7cbba4016ad964c5d93deb7570cf3a9a5055e196/ss_7cbba4016ad964c5d93deb7570cf3a9a5055e196.600x338.jpg?t=1779837417","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/7cbba4016ad964c5d93deb7570cf3a9a5055e196/ss_7cbba4016ad964c5d93deb7570cf3a9a5055e196.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779837417"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/99b1399e2bcc6b4ad76f5c2a45e1f8867b4fcbf2/ss_99b1399e2bcc6b4ad76f5c2a45e1f8867b4fcbf2.600x338.jpg?t=1779837417","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/99b1399e2bcc6b4ad76f5c2a45e1f8867b4fcbf2/ss_99b1399e2bcc6b4ad76f5c2a45e1f8867b4fcbf2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779837417"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/8fba70409790946fcfcf8379bba446e0a7d268df/ss_8fba70409790946fcfcf8379bba446e0a7d268df.600